  "execution_status": "not_run_in_this_delivery",
  "requirements": "# Crusher feed and dust-extraction cross limiting\n\n- **Difficulty:** Medium (medium)\n\n## Requirements\n\n1. Implement FB_CrusherExtraction to coordinate ore-crusher feed and dust extraction. FeedDemand, FeedActual and ExtractionCapacity are finite LREAL values in the common normalized dust-load-equivalent range 0..100. ExtractionCapacity is the feed rate supported by measured extraction, and FeedActual is the extraction required by measured feed. Engineering-unit normalization occurs upstream.\n\n2. For Enable=TRUE, Trip=FALSE and legal inputs, compute FeedSP=MIN(FeedDemand,ExtractionCapacity) and ExtractionSP=MAX(FeedDemand,FeedActual) every scan. Use actual measured capabilities, not the other channel setpoint.\n\n3. For an increasing demand, feed remains limited by actual extraction capacity. For a decreasing demand, extraction must remain sufficient for actual feed until feed decreases.\n\n4. Trip=TRUE or Enable=FALSE has priority: set both setpoints to zero and Error=FALSE. Otherwise any numeric value outside 0..100 sets both setpoints to zero and Error=TRUE. Legal computation clears Error.\n\n5. Keep no integral, timer or queue state. Compute directly on the first call. This block only computes normalized setpoints; it does not establish actual dust concentration, implement filter cleaning or model extraction-fan post-purge. Absolute numeric tolerance is 1e-6.\n\n## Interface Definition\n\n| Direction | Variable/Field | Data Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Input | `Enable` | `BOOL` | Enable coordination. |\n| Input | `Trip` | `BOOL` | Benchmark setpoint-withdrawal signal. |\n| Input | `FeedDemand` | `LREAL` | Demand, 0..100 equivalent dust load. |\n| Input | `FeedActual` | `LREAL` | Extraction required by measured feed, 0..100. |\n| Input | `ExtractionCapacity` | `LREAL` | Feed supported by measured extraction, 0..100. |\n| Output | `FeedSP` | `LREAL` | Feed-channel setpoint. |\n| Output | `ExtractionSP` | `LREAL` | Dust-extraction setpoint. |\n| Output | `Error` | `BOOL` | Illegal numeric input. |",
  "ltl": {
    "id": "CUSTOM_07",
    "title": "矿石破碎给料与抽尘风量交叉限幅",
    "definitions": "active := Enable AND !Trip。valid表示FeedDemand、FeedActual、ExtractionCapacity三个有限LREAL均在[0,100]。\nfeedOK := FeedSP=min(FeedDemand,ExtractionCapacity)。extractionOK := ExtractionSP=max(FeedDemand,FeedActual)。\n两个反馈必须来自实际能力，不能使用对方的设定值代替。Trip和禁用优先于参数错误。",
    "properties": [
      {
        "id": "P01",
        "formula": "G(!active -> (FeedSP=0 & ExtractionSP=0 & !Error))"
      },
      {
        "id": "P02",
        "formula": "G((active & !valid) -> (FeedSP=0 & ExtractionSP=0 & Error))"
      },
      {
        "id": "P03",
        "formula": "G((active & valid) -> (feedOK & extractionOK & !Error))"
      },
      {
        "id": "P04",
        "formula": "G((active & valid) -> (FeedSP<=ExtractionCapacity & ExtractionSP>=FeedActual))"
      },
      {
        "id": "P05",
        "formula": "G(0<=FeedSP & FeedSP<=100 & 0<=ExtractionSP & ExtractionSP<=100)"
      }
    ],
    "status": "specification_not_proved"
  },
